e pay the fee  for us to recount those ballots green  says that could be costly  it can be substantial to do a recount i  reached out to miller  anthony cannazzaro and becker about a  potential recount in their races  but they did not get back to me in  regards to the presidential race  green says biden has a wide enough lead  that he does not expect president trump  to ask for a recount here in nevada  orco mana 8 news now orco thank you

